                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "FDwDJ",
                  "name": "rmNoteTitle",
                  "fill": "#222222",
                  "content": "关键需求标注",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "aHvJX",
                  "name": "rmNoteWrap",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#F7F7F7",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": 16,
                  "gap": 10,
                  "cornerRadius": 6,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Utuet",
                      "name": "rmNote0",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "1. 本矩阵为从 PRD 2.3.2 的文字描述推导，PRD 未给出明确权限表，属悬空点 G-11，需评审确认（尤其『审核员能否看规则』这类边界）。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "gmG5Q",
                      "name": "rmNote1",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "2. 权限需同时作用于两处：① 前端菜单/按钮渲染 ② 后端接口鉴权。仅隐藏菜单不算权限控制。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "yL5IA",
                      "name": "rmNote2",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "3. 强制职责分离：处置动作仅审核员可执行，规则变更仅策略师可执行，审计与配置仅管理员可执行——三者互不重叠。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "wNEFH",
                      "name": "rmNote3",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "4. 「仿真测试」因不产生业务副作用，开放给审核员与策略师双方使用。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
